---
/**
 * 订阅区（原在 BaseLayout 内，抽出以便文章页复用/隐藏）
 */
---

<section class="py-[88px] px-[120px] bg-paper">
  <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto text-center flex flex-col gap-5">
    <p class="text-[13px] font-medium tracking-[1.8px] text-accent">订阅</p>
    <h2 class="text-[36px] leading-[48px] font-bold">每周三，一封只讲一件事的信</h2>
    <p class="text-[16px] leading-[29px] text-ink-2">
      一篇能照着做的处方，或者一条我踩过的坑。不转发新闻，不发工具合集。随时可退。
    </p>
    <form class="flex gap-3 justify-center mt-2" action="#" method="post">
      <label class="sr-only" for="subscribe-email">邮箱地址</label>
      <input
        id="subscribe-email"
        type="email"
        name="email"
        required
        placeholder="你的邮箱"
        class="w-[340px] h-[52px] px-5 rounded-[9px] bg-white border border-rule text-[15px] focus:outline-none focus:border-accent"
      />
      <button
        type="submit"
        class="h-[52px] px-8 rounded-[9px] bg-accent text-white font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition"
      >订阅</button>
    </form>
    <p class="text-[13px] text-ink-3">
      也支持 <a href="/rss.xml" class="text-accent underline">RSS 阅读器</a> 订阅
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
